# Pairs with NoStaleAuthority. Only a captured deadline the silo has renewed
# past may pass while the silo's lease still stands; the mutant lets an
# unrenewed one pass too, while the silo still trusts the old snapshot.
MODULE: CaptureAgesWhileTied
TARGET: NoStaleAuthority
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a captured deadline the silo has not renewed past lapses on its own
PERTURBS: CaptureAges

--- FIND
    /\ pend[t] = "open"
    /\ pend' = [pend EXCEPT ![t] = "lapsed"]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: an unrenewed capture lapses early.
    /\ pend[t] \in {"open", "tied"}
    /\ pend' = [pend EXCEPT ![t] = "lapsed"]
--- END
